Zstandard
Zstandard is a fast lossless compression algorithm and library.

Home page: https://facebook.github.io/zstd/
License: BSD-3-Clause/GPL-2.0-only dual license
License URL: https://github.com/facebook/zstd/blob/dev/LICENSE

The selected release is defined in `projects/versions.mk`. Only libzstd is
cross-compiled; the command-line program, tests, and contrib targets are not
needed by the packaged Python runtime.
